{"id":"n79673-3-4","stage":5,"title":"찜 · 热敷","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79673-3-4-1","ko":"큰일이네, 열이 내려가질 않아.","zh":"糟了，烧一直退不下来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"큰일이네,","meaning":"大事","explanation":"큰일：大事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"큰일","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72174","senseId":"2","lemma":"큰일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰일이네","audio":"/audio/b602e35018eb0ddb0437.mp3"}},{"text":"열이","meaning":"热，烧","explanation":"열：热，烧；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"열","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67807","senseId":"1","lemma":"열","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열이","audio":"/audio/b032403c1ae7d430787a.mp3"}},{"text":"내려가질","meaning":"下跌，下降","explanation":"내려가다：下跌，下降；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"내려가다","audio":"/audio/d27a99abb5cf233cc101.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63723","senseId":"7","lemma":"내려가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내려가질","audio":"/audio/1a738bef8c9928fa32d8.mp3"}},{"text":"않아.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않아","audio":"/audio/691c8d98a5312caac1ac.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dbfb08997ec518d3","term":"큰일","zh":"大事","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3","entryId":"72174","definition":"无法挽回的大事故或不好的事情。","pronunciation":["크닐"]},{"id":"6f4112362e973dd6","term":"열","zh":"热，烧","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3","entryId":"67807","definition":"生病是在体内产生的热气。","pronunciation":["열"]},{"id":"d27a99abb5cf233c","term":"내려가다","zh":"下跌，下降","audio":"/audio/d27a99abb5cf233cc101.mp3","entryId":"63723","definition":"价格、统计数据、温度或物价等降下来。","pronunciation":["내려가다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/c252268a6640d9fcbf51.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n79673-3-4-2","ko":"주머니에 얼음을 넣고 이마에 찜을 좀 해 봐.","zh":"把冰放进袋子里，给额头敷一敷吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주머니에","meaning":"口袋，袋子","explanation":"주머니：口袋，袋子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주머니","audio":"/audio/5739db1617eef912c0b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75803","senseId":"1","lemma":"주머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주머니에","audio":"/audio/d30ac73d72f116237ee8.mp3"}},{"text":"얼음을","meaning":"冰","explanation":"얼음：冰；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"얼음","audio":"/audio/84ce6fedead1613f15cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67327","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼음을","audio":"/audio/e919ba694c12067516c2.mp3"}},{"text":"넣고","meaning":"放进，装进","explanation":"넣다：放进，装进；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"1","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣고","audio":"/audio/bc9dd322908f47e194c3.mp3"}},{"text":"이마에","meaning":"额，前额，额头","explanation":"이마：额，前额，额头；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이마","audio":"/audio/772813c770d7cbf82ae4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71693","senseId":"1","lemma":"이마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이마에","audio":"/audio/48c59755c2fdb7c5bea8.mp3"}},{"text":"찜을","meaning":"热敷，冷敷","explanation":"찜：热敷，冷敷；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"찜","audio":"/audio/0051b7404a6e9ea20d01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79673","senseId":"3","lemma":"찜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찜을","audio":"/audio/583a63d5e17bdfb4a34e.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"给别人产生某种影响或怎样对待别人。","explanation":"하다：给别人产生某种影响或怎样对待别人；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"24","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5739db1617eef912","term":"주머니","zh":"口袋，袋子","audio":"/audio/5739db1617eef912c0b4.mp3","entryId":"75803","definition":"用布或皮制成的，可装钱或物的东西。","pronunciation":["주머니"]},{"id":"84ce6fedead1613f","term":"얼음","zh":"冰","audio":"/audio/84ce6fedead1613f15cf.mp3","entryId":"67327","definition":"水冻成坚硬的东西。","pronunciation":["어름"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放进，装进","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使进入某个空间里。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"772813c770d7cbf8","term":"이마","zh":"额，前额，额头","audio":"/audio/772813c770d7cbf82ae4.mp3","entryId":"71693","definition":"指人脸眉毛以上、头发以下的部分。","pronunciation":["이마"]},{"id":"0051b7404a6e9ea2","term":"찜","zh":"热敷，冷敷","audio":"/audio/0051b7404a6e9ea20d01.mp3","entryId":"79673","definition":"把热水浸湿的布片或装有冰块的袋子放在疼痛的地方帮助治疗。","pronunciation":["찜"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"给别人产生某种影响或怎样对待别人。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"给别人产生某种影响或怎样对待别人。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/143020765693b53205f9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.233,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79673","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":154,"sequenceScore":3.0597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["糟了，烧一直退不下来。","把冰放进袋子里，给额头敷一敷吧。","你终于要去欧洲旅行了，对吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["糟了，烧一直退不下来。","把冰放进袋子里，给额头敷一敷吧。","你终于要去欧洲旅行了，对吧？"],"answer":1}]}
